{"title": "Death Burst: Force", "pageid": 20568, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Death_Burst:_Force", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Force.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Generic_Force.webp/300px-Generic_Force.webp, /w/images/8/82/Generic_Force.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Generic_Force.webp/300px-Generic_Force.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/82/Generic_Force.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Death Burst: Force</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Mud_Mephit\" title=\"Mud Mephit\">Mud Mephit</a> Passive Feature. If the Mud Mephit dies, it automatically explodes, dealing force damage to all nearby creatures.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When the mephit dies, it explodes with a force that deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> damage to all creatures within 2 m (7 ft). \n</p><p>On a successful save, the creatures still take half damage.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Mud_Mephit\" title=\"Ancient Mud Mephit\">Ancient Mud Mephit</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Boney\" title=\"Boney\">Boney</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grease_Mephit\" title=\"Grease Mephit\">Grease Mephit</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mud_Mephit\" title=\"Mud Mephit\">Mud Mephit</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Young_Grease_Mephit\" title=\"Young Grease Mephit\">Young Grease Mephit</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Young_Mud_Mephit\" title=\"Young Mud Mephit\">Young Mud Mephit</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715020459\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 750/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4216/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2377/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 511/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643724/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.376      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   30.376      1 -total\n 35.45%   10.769      1 Template:DamageText\n 31.33%    9.517      1 Template:Damage_type\n 30.32%    9.211      1 Template:Icon_link\n 29.28%    8.893      1 Template:Icon_text\n 27.41%    8.325      7 Template:Trim\n 21.97%    6.674      1